{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p052a","title":"汉帝再使张音奉玺绶","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p052a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"汉帝再使张音奉玺绶","evidence":["wendi-e-p052a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"诏命","evidence":["wendi-e-p052a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0012","role":"奉使","evidence":["wendi-e-p052a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年十月壬戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年十月壬戌"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p052a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p052a-q","source_order":[2,165,"P052a"],"order":540}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0012","name":"张音","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p052a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-802c78e03b48673f90d7","layer":"pei","quote":"壬戌，册诏曰：“皇帝问魏王言：遣宗奉庚申书到，所称引，闻之。朕惟汉家世逾二十，年过四百；运周数终，行祚已讫；天心已移，兆民望绝；天之所废，有自来矣。今大命有所厎止，神器当归圣德；违众不顺，逆天不祥。王其体有虞之盛德，应历数之嘉会；是以祯祥告符，图谶表录，神人同应，受命咸宜。朕畏上帝，致位于王；天不可违，众不可拂。且重华不逆尧命，大禹不辞舜位。若夫由、卷匹夫，不载圣籍；固非皇材帝器，所当称慕。今使音，奉皇帝玺绶，王其陟帝位；无逆朕命，以祗奉天心焉。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":226},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
